<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/14/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "On the date of coming into operation of this Act, any investigation, prosecution or proceedings in respect of any offence under the repealed Act pending under the repealed Act may be continued as if the repealed Act is still in force."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/14/eng@> .
